  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#interactive-content\r\n\r\n> The tabindex attribute can also make any element into interactive content.\r\n\r\nThe word \"can\" is ambiguous in this context. \r\nMight tabindex also not make an element interactive in some cases?\r\nWould it be precise to say \"The tabindex attribute makes any element..\"?",
